  /**
   * Initializes the algorithm with a compatible profile/guide B-spline network.
   * @param theProfiles profile curves evaluated in U direction
   * @param theGuides guide curves evaluated in V direction
   * @param theProfileParameters V parameters locating profiles on guide skin
   * @param theGuideParameters U parameters locating guides on profile skin
   * @param theIntersectionPoints validated profile/guide contact grid
   * @param theIntersectionWeights rational weights for the contact grid
   * @param theTolerance geometric tolerance for closed-seam checks
   * @param theIsUClosed indicates that first/last guide curves close the U seam
   * @param theIsVClosed indicates that first/last profile curves close the V seam
   */
